Commit:     Fabricio Breve <fbreve@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Sat Oct 24 22:41:33 2026 -0300

    Fix audio restart sequencing across savestates
    
    Preserve AudioMix channel phase and pending PSG tick semantics across savestate capture and restore.
    
    Extend the savestate format to version 16 without increasing the payload, ensuring deterministic stereo update order and preventing pending PSG ticks from being lost at accepted capture boundaries.
    
    Keep SAVE-only and LOAD audio output independent of transport duration while preserving the existing PSG state restoration behavior.

